creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9450152Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9450456Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9451581Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9452090Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9452409Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9453674Z    if you are ready to continue.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9453938Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9454520Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9455327Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9456004Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9456514Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9456771Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9457012Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9457405Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9457689Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9458231Z    can use Nix.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9458418Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9458572Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9458823Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9459337Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9459995Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9460319Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9460472Z I will:
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9460679Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9460898Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9461456Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9461998Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9462693Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9463085Z  - install Nix in /nix
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9463456Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9464031Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9464577Z    /root
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9472209Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9473014Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9486178Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9486927Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9487604Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9487916Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9488396Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9500554Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9501309Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9509676Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9510939Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9511955Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9512676Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9513430Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9513870Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9514170Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9514892Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9515250Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9515399Z If you would like to
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9515785Z see the output, try like this:
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9516096Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9516361Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9516907Z   $ sh ./install-nix
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9517143Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9520775Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9521188Z ^[[32m~~> Checking for artifacts of previous installs
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9521720Z ^[[0mBefore I try to install, I'll check for signs Nix already is or has
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9522152Z been installed on this system.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:13.9560902Z 
