creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:15.2303267Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:15.2303379Z # enable bash completion in interactive shells
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:37:15.2303675Z #if ! shopt -oq posix; then
